Description: DaVinci's dv.reportrate package provides a module for computing and visualising adverse‑event‑derived
   reporting rates over time. It supports SDTM‑conformant datasets (DM, DS, AE) as well as similarly structured
   study‑specific data. The module offers cumulative and interval‑based metrics, flexible time alignment options
   (by study date or study day), and categorical grouping with user‑selectable levels. The module includes hover‑enabled
   interactive plots and uses colour‑blind‑friendly palettes where possible.
